Before writing or editing technical documentation, read `skills/writing-technical-documentation/SKILL.md` and follow it.
Read files under its `references/` folder only when SKILL.md points to them.
After drafting, run `python3 skills/writing-technical-documentation/scripts/slop_scan.py <file>` and fix what it flags.
